01:37:22.730 --> 01:37:23.550
Nilikuwa na nia.

1091
01:37:24.570 --> 01:37:29.050
Lakini sasa nina uhakika siku haitatokea ambapo hutahitaji Batman tena.

1092
01:37:30.530 --> 01:37:31.450
Natumaini ni hivyo,

1093
01:37:32.920 --> 01:37:34.420
na ikiwa itafanya, nitakuwapo,

1094
01:37:36.080 --> 01:37:37.180
lakini kama rafiki yako.

1095
01:37:38.080 --> 01:37:39.180
Mimi ni radhi, Harvey.

1096
01:37:40.380 --> 01:37:41.940
Naomba radhi kukuvunja moyo.

1097
01:37:42.980 --> 01:37:46.840
Ikiwa utapoteza imani yako katika mimi, tafadhali endelea kuwa na imani katika watu.

1098
01:37:48.720 --> 01:37:51.820
Upendo sasa na daima, Rachel.

1099
01:37:51.820 --> 01:37:52.460
Je, alifanya

1100
01:38:12.360 --> 01:38:13.260
Je, nilimletea hilo?

1101
01:38:15.480 --> 01:38:16.920
Nilipaswa kuchochea mema,

1102
01:38:17.900 --> 01:38:20.200
si wazimu, si kifo.

1103
01:38:20.480 --> 01:38:24.880
Umeongoza vizuri, lakini umewapiga nyuso wahalifu wa Gotham.

1104
01:38:25.260 --> 01:38:27.040
Je, hujafikiri kwamba huenda kukawa na watu waliopoteza uhai?

1105
01:38:27.440 --> 01:38:29.860
Mambo yalizidi kuwa mabaya kabla ya kuwa bora.

1106
01:38:30.280 --> 01:38:34.640
Lakini Rachel, Alfred- Rachel aliamini katika kile wewe kusimama kwa,

1107
01:38:35.680 --> 01:38:37.320
kile tunachosimama kwa ajili yake.

1108
01:38:37.680 --> 01:38:39.180
Gotham anahitaji wewe.

1109
01:38:39.180 --> 01:38:41.700
Hapana, Gotham inahitaji shujaa wake wa kweli,

1110
01:38:43.200 --> 01:38:47.320
na nikamruhusu psychopath huyo wauaji amwangamize nusu hadi kwenye helo.

1111
01:38:47.680 --> 01:38:48.920
Hiyo ndiyo sababu, kwa sasa,

1112
01:38:50.880 --> 01:38:52.320
wewe utakuwa na kufanya kufanya na wewe mwenyewe.

1113
01:38:54.990 --> 01:38:56.430
Alikuwa akitaka kuningojea, Alfred.

1114
01:38:58.890 --> 01:38:59.590
Dan hajui.

1115
01:39:00.990 --> 01:39:01.810
Hatasikia kamwe.

1116
01:39:08.150 --> 01:39:10.990
Mhalifu huyo katika msitu huko Burma,

1117
01:39:12.170 --> 01:39:13.910
Je, umemkamata?

1118
01:39:14.410 --> 01:39:14.590
Jinsi gani?

1119
01:39:17.020 --> 01:39:18.320
Tulichoma msitu.

1120
01:39:57.550 --> 01:40:01.170
Yeye ni chanzo kuaminika, M & A wakili kutoka kampuni ya ushauri mashuhuri, na anasema

1121
01:40:01.170 --> 01:40:03.790
Yeye alingojea muda mrefu kama anaweza kwa ajili ya Batman kufanya jambo sahihi.

1122
01:40:04.430 --> 01:40:06.240
Na sasa yeye ni kuchukua- mambo katika mikono yake mwenyewe.

1123
01:40:06.420 --> 01:40:08.840
Tutaishi saa tano na utambulisho wa kweli wa Batman.

1124
01:40:30.490 --> 01:40:34.130
Daktari anasema una maumivu makali lakini hukubali dawa.

1125
01:40:36.090 --> 01:40:40.110
Kwamba unakataa kukubali mipasuko ya ngozi.

1126
01:40:40.650 --> 01:40:46.550
Kumbuka jina kwamba wote walikuwa na kwa ajili yangu wakati mimi nilikuwa

1127
01:40:46.550 --> 01:40:47.710
katika Mambo ya Ndani.

1128
01:40:51.500 --> 01:40:52.420
Ilikuwa nini, Gordon?

1129
01:40:53.380 --> 01:40:53.700
Harvey.

1130
01:41:07.650 --> 01:41:08.970
Je, alikuwa

1131
01:41:23.500 --> 01:41:24.200
kufanya kazi kwa ajili yao?

1132
01:41:26.640 --> 01:41:28.600
Yahoo ilichukua Rachel.

1133
01:41:29.800 --> 01:41:32.560
Harvey Nahitaji kujua ni nani wa watu wangu ninaweza kuamini.

1134
01:41:33.280 --> 01:41:34.820
Kwa nini unanisikiliza sasa?

1135
01:41:36.360 --> 01:41:37.000
- Ninaomba radhi.

1136
01:41:55.360 --> 01:41:58.240
Unapaswa kufikiria juu ya hilo kabla ya kumruhusu clown kutoka kwenye sanduku.

1137
01:41:58.900 --> 01:41:59.600
Unamtaka?

1138
01:42:03.200 --> 01:42:04.780
Naweza kukuambia ni wapi itakuwa alasiri hii.

1139
01:42:13.620 --> 01:42:15.420
Oh ni wazimu kama wewe kuangalia.

1140
01:42:15.900 --> 01:42:18.440
Nilikuambia mimi ni mtu wa neno langu.

1141
01:42:22.740 --> 01:42:23.960
Kiitaliano yuko wapi?

1142
01:42:24.340 --> 01:42:27.400
Vikundi vyote vya kijeshi vitashirikiana kwenye eneo hilo katika dakika 20.

1143
01:42:27.660 --> 01:42:31.020
Nataka vikundi vya msaidizi vifunike njia zote za kutoroka.

1144
01:42:32.840 --> 01:42:36.100
Joker, nini wewe kufanya na fedha yako yote?

1145
01:42:37.080 --> 01:42:38.620
Unaona mimi ni mtu wa ladha rahisi.

1146
01:42:39.820 --> 01:42:40.700
Ninafurahia

1147
01:42:42.780 --> 01:42:46.520
dynamite na gunpowder na petroli.

1148
01:42:49.100 --> 01:42:49.620
Ni nini hiki?

1149
01:42:50.620 --> 01:42:50.620
Na

1150
01:42:53.020 --> 01:42:54.940
Unajua kitu ambacho wanafanana?

1151
01:42:56.380 --> 01:42:57.140
Wao ni ya bei rahisi.

1152
01:42:57.960 --> 01:43:00.600
Nataka kujua ni kiasi gani wanakupa kwa kukuambia ni nani Batman kweli.

1153
01:43:00.620 --> 01:43:02.900
Hii ni nafasi yetu.

1154
01:43:03.120 --> 01:43:04.420
Joker kwa njia yoyote.

1155
01:43:05.000 --> 01:43:06.300
Hey Jim kupata mzigo wa hii.

1156
01:43:06.620 --> 01:43:09.720
Harvey Dent hakutaka kuachana na wazimu huyu.

1157
01:43:10.000 --> 01:43:14.000
Je, unafikiri unajua vizuri kuliko yeye?

1158
01:43:14.000 --> 01:43:16.920
Na tunamtakia kupona haraka.

1159
01:43:17.440 --> 01:43:19.280
Mungu anajua tunamhitaji sasa.

1160
01:43:22.300 --> 01:43:22.840
Mimi ni

1161
01:43:25.120 --> 01:43:27.240
na kuchoma nusu yangu tu.

1162
01:43:29.950 --> 01:43:31.550
Wewe hujali tu pesa.

1163
01:43:32.370 --> 01:43:34.790
Jiji hili linastahili jamii bora ya wahalifu.

1164
01:43:35.850 --> 01:43:37.350
Na nitampa.

1165
01:43:38.870 --> 01:43:40.990
Waambie watu wako kwamba wanafanya kazi kwa ajili yangu sasa.

1166
01:43:41.510 --> 01:43:42.710
Hii ni mji wangu.

1167
01:43:44.050 --> 01:43:47.030
Hawatakuwa na kazi kwa ajili ya freak.

1168
01:43:47.970 --> 01:43:52.370
Kwa nini hatukukukata katika vipande vidogo na kukupa chakula kwa pooches yako.

1169
01:43:53.130 --> 01:43:57.370
Na kisha tutaona jinsi mbwa mwenye njaa anavyoweza kuwa mwaminifu.

1170
01:43:57.710 --> 01:43:59.690
Si kuhusu fedha.

1171
01:44:00.650 --> 01:44:03.330
Ni kuhusu kutuma ujumbe.

1172
01:44:04.870 --> 01:44:06.050
Kila kitu kinachomwa.

1173
01:44:08.830 --> 01:44:10.370
Ni nani huyu?

1174
01:44:10.710 --> 01:44:14.370
Nilikuwa na maono ya ulimwengu bila Batman.

1175
01:44:15.090 --> 01:44:20.150
Mafia yalipata faida kidogo na polisi walijaribu kuwazuia kwenye mlango mmoja

1176
01:44:20.150 --> 01:44:23.430
Na ilikuwa hivyo...

1177
01:44:24.960 --> 01:44:26.400
Nimebadilika moyo.

1178
01:44:27.120 --> 01:44:32.190
Sitaki Mr. Reese kuharibu kila kitu lakini kwa nini mimi kuwa na furaha yote?

1179
01:44:32.550 --> 01:44:34.510
Hebu kumpa mwingine nafasi.

1180
01:44:34.870 --> 01:44:40.690
Kama Coleman Reese si wafu katika dakika 60 basi mimi kupasuka

1181
01:44:40.690 --> 01:44:43.350
nataka uite kila afisa.

1182
01:44:43.750 --> 01:44:46.890
Waambie waende hospitali yao ya karibu na kuanza kuhamisha na kutafuta.

1183
01:44:47.150 --> 01:44:49.050
Piga simu kwa mamlaka ya usafiri, baraza la shule, magereza.

1184
01:44:49.190 --> 01:44:51.030
Fanya kila basi linalopatikana hadi hospitali.

1185
01:44:51.390 --> 01:44:53.590
Kipaumbele ni Gotham General.

1186
01:44:53.890 --> 01:44:55.910
Watoa wote nje ya mahali hapo sasa hivi.

1187
01:44:56.170 --> 01:44:57.510
Wewe, wewe na wewe, wewe kuja na mimi.

1188
01:44:57.670 --> 01:44:59.530
Tunakwenda wapi, bwana?

1189
01:44:59.970 --> 01:45:03.110
Ninahitaji wewe kuunganishwa katika kuangalia watu Gordon na familia zao.

1190
01:45:03.690 --> 01:45:05.370
Unatafuta hospitali?

1191
01:45:05.770 --> 01:45:07.310
Je, wewe ni mmoja katika capsule nyuma, bwana?

1192
01:45:07.490 --> 01:45:09.350
Katikati ya mchana, Alfred.

1193
01:45:09.750 --> 01:45:10.670
Lamborghini basi?

1194
01:45:11.850 --> 01:45:12.850
Ni nyembamba zaidi.

1195
01:45:36.930 --> 01:45:40.290
Bwana, Kamishna, Je, kweli unafikiri raia wa kawaida angejaribu kuua hii

1196
01:45:40.290 --> 01:45:40.450
Mtu?

1197
01:46:04.470 --> 01:46:07.770
Hakuna mshiriki wa familia ya karibu ambaye amekuwa katika hospitali ya Gotham.

1198
01:46:09.250 --> 01:46:11.710
Labda Batman anaweza kumwokoa.

1199
01:46:26.110 --> 01:46:27.450
Davis, nina nafasi.

1200
01:46:30.370 --> 01:46:30.710
Davis!

1201
01:46:37.250 --> 01:46:39.090
Ni Burns na Zachary.

1202
01:46:39.890 --> 01:46:42.450
Hakuna kitu juu yao. Na polisi, sijui.

1203
01:46:51.430 --> 01:46:52.630
Tutatuma habari kwa Gordon.

1204
01:47:09.700 --> 01:47:10.960
Bibi, tutapaswa kumhamisha sasa.

1205
01:47:23.910 --> 01:47:24.870
Ni Berg, sivyo?

1206
01:47:27.310 --> 01:47:28.010
Wewe ni vizuri, mwana?

1207
01:47:53.100 --> 01:47:58.160
Je, unajua, sitaki kuwe na hisia mbaya kati yetu, Harvey.

1208
01:47:58.960 --> 01:48:04.900
Wakati wewe na Rachel walikuwa kutekwa nyara, mimi alikuwa

1209
01:48:04.900 --> 01:48:06.320
kukaa katika kifungo cha Gordon.

1210
01:48:07.860 --> 01:48:09.500
Mimi si rigs mashtaka hayo.

1211
01:48:10.080 --> 01:48:11.680
Wewe ni mtu, wewe ni mipango.

1212
01:48:12.640 --> 01:48:14.480
Je, mimi kweli kuangalia kama guy na mpango?

1213
01:48:15.540 --> 01:48:18.480
Unajua mimi ni nini? Mimi ni mbwa kuendesha magari.

1214
01:48:18.980 --> 01:48:21.000
Singejua nifanye nini na moja ikiwa ningeliipata.

1215
01:48:21.580 --> 01:48:23.900
Unajua, mimi tu kufanya mambo.

1216
01:48:25.040 --> 01:48:26.480
Watu wana mipango.

1217
01:48:26.820 --> 01:48:28.540
Polisi wana mipango.

1218
01:48:29.060 --> 01:48:30.280
Gordon ana mipango.

1219
01:48:31.360 --> 01:48:33.200
Unajua, wao ni wajanja.

1220
01:48:34.320 --> 01:48:37.240
Wafanya-maovu wanaojaribu kudhibiti ulimwengu wao mdogo.

1221
01:48:38.120 --> 01:48:39.520
Mimi si mjanja.

1222
01:48:40.000 --> 01:48:45.900
Mimi kujaribu kuonyesha wajanja jinsi ya kusikitisha majaribio yao ya kudhibiti mambo

1223
01:48:45.900 --> 01:48:46.700
kweli ni.

1224
01:48:48.140 --> 01:48:54.080
Hivyo wakati mimi kusema kwamba wewe na mpenzi wako walikuwa hakuna

1225
01:48:54.080 --> 01:48:54.660
binafsi,

1226
01:48:55.880 --> 01:48:58.120
utajua kwamba nasema kweli.

1227
01:49:08.620 --> 01:49:09.580
Mke wangu ni katika hospitali.

1228
01:49:10.560 --> 01:49:10.860
Ndiyo, hiyo.

1229
01:49:13.190 --> 01:49:16.170
Wajanja ambao wamekuweka mahali ulipo.

1230
01:49:16.310 --> 01:49:19.410
Wewe ulikuwa mjanja, ulikuwa na mipango.

1231
01:49:20.310 --> 01:49:22.430
Na angalia ambapo hiyo imekuleta.

1232
01:49:33.560 --> 01:49:36.860
Ni bila shaka kuchukuliwa kila tahadhari iwezekanavyo na kudai kila mtu si kuchukua

1233
01:49:36.860 --> 01:49:40.200
Mimi tu alifanya kile mimi kufanya bora.

1234
01:49:40.720 --> 01:49:42.080
Nilichukua mpango wako mdogo.

1235
01:49:42.200 --> 01:49:43.740
Niligeuza mwenyewe.

1236
01:49:43.740 --> 01:49:49.020
Angalia ni nini nilifanya kwa mji huu na drums chache za gesi na risasi kadhaa.

1237
01:49:51.060 --> 01:49:53.040
Unajua nilichokiona?

1238
01:49:53.660 --> 01:49:56.000
Hakuna mtu anayeogopa mambo yanapoenda sawasawa na jinsi yalivyo.

1239
01:49:57.220 --> 01:49:58.800
Hata kama mpango ni kutisha.

1240
01:49:59.640 --> 01:50:04.000
Kama kesho mimi kuwaambia vyombo vya habari kwamba kama gang banger itakuwa risasi.

1241
01:50:05.080 --> 01:50:07.980
lori kubwa la askari itakuwa kupasuka.

1242
01:50:08.600 --> 01:50:14.580
Hakuna mtu panics kwa sababu ni sehemu ya mpango, lakini wakati mimi kusema kwamba

1243
01:50:14.580 --> 01:50:17.420
Meya mmoja mdogo mzee atakufa,

1244
01:50:18.540 --> 01:50:20.160
basi kila mtu kupoteza akili zao.

1245
01:50:24.460 --> 01:50:26.140
Kuanzisha anarchy kidogo,

1246
01:50:28.790 --> 01:50:34.310
kuharibu utaratibu uliotekelezwa, na kila kitu huwa fujo.

1247
01:50:38.360 --> 01:50:38.760
Oh, ni kweli.

1248
01:50:40.780 --> 01:50:42.180
na unajua jambo kuhusu ghasia,

1249
01:50:45.080 --> 01:50:45.860
ni hofu.

1250
01:51:32.510 --> 01:51:33.770
Hiyo ni Mr Wayne, sivyo?

1251
01:51:34.870 --> 01:51:36.290
Hiyo ni jambo hodari sana ulilofanya.

1252
01:51:36.630 --> 01:51:39.410
Kujaribu kupata mwanga?

1253
01:51:39.810 --> 01:51:40.730
Kwa nini?

1254
01:51:46.360 --> 01:51:48.280
Je, unafikiri niende hospitali?

1255
01:51:48.800 --> 01:51:50.720
Huoni habari nyingi, sivyo, Mheshimiwa.

1256
01:51:50.820 --> 01:51:50.880
Wayne?

1257
01:53:10.950 --> 01:53:12.550
Watu 50 waliopotea, basi moja.

1258
01:53:12.950 --> 01:53:14.830
Mabasi mengine yote yanaelekea hospitali nyingine.

1259
01:53:15.150 --> 01:53:16.390
Nadhani tumekosa moja.

1260
01:53:16.530 --> 01:53:18.070
Je, unafikiri bendi ya Harvey iko wapi?

1261
01:53:18.410 --> 01:53:20.010
Endelea kutafuta na kuiweka kwa ajili yako mwenyewe.

1262
01:53:20.010 --> 01:53:21.770
Mtu yeyote kuuliza, sisi got yake nje.

1263
01:53:25.470 --> 01:53:26.690
Nipe ofisi ya meya kulia.

1264
01:53:29.060 --> 01:53:30.440
Tutahitaji Walinzi wa Taifa.

1265
01:53:30.960 --> 01:53:33.720
Watu bado hawapo, ikiwa ni pamoja na Mike Engle wa GCN.

1266
01:53:33.820 --> 01:53:37.520
Sasa ninaambiwa kwamba tunataka kukata video ambayo GCN imepokea tu.

1267
01:53:37.840 --> 01:53:39.260
Mimi ni Mike Engle, kwa Gotham usiku huu.

1268
01:53:40.060 --> 01:53:42.220
Ni nini kinachohitajiwa ili kuwafanya watu watake kujiunga?

1269
01:53:43.280 --> 01:53:44.640
Ulikosa kumuua wakili.

1270
01:53:45.160 --> 01:53:47.160
Lazima nikupate kutoka benchi na kuingia katika mchezo.

1271
01:53:49.920 --> 01:53:51.700
Kuja usiku, mji huu ni wangu,

1272
01:53:52.620 --> 01:53:54.240
na yeyote aliyebaki hapa hucheza kwa sheria zangu.

1273
01:53:55.080 --> 01:53:58.700
Mheshimiwa Fox, usalama inaonyesha uvamizi katika idara ya Utafiti na maendeleo.

1274
01:53:59.020 --> 01:54:00.200
Kama hutaki kuwa katika mchezo,

1275
01:54:01.480 --> 01:54:02.780
Ondoka sasa.

1276
01:54:04.820 --> 01:54:07.400
Lakini umati wa watu wa daraja na mfereji ni hakika kwa mshangao.

1277
01:54:14.500 --> 01:54:14.900
Haipaswi

1278
01:54:47.610 --> 01:54:50.370
wewe kuwa nje, unajua, kufanya kitu?

1279
01:54:51.230 --> 01:54:52.050
Ni siku yangu ya likizo.

1280
01:54:53.630 --> 01:54:54.490
Lazima nifanye kuruka.

1281
01:54:55.430 --> 01:54:56.530
Weka jicho kwa ajili yangu, unaweza?

1282
01:55:03.470 --> 01:55:05.410
Sasa nini, unahitaji mtu wa kutikisa kwa ajili yako?

1283
01:55:05.630 --> 01:55:05.930
-Hello, nilimwona.

1284
01:55:10.980 --> 01:55:12.280
Nilidhani wewe ni wafu.

1285
01:55:21.800 --> 01:55:23.520
Lazima kuwa ni mtu wa Maroni.

1286
01:55:25.200 --> 01:55:29.020
Je, wewe ni kusema kwamba wewe ni kwenda kulinda msaliti mwingine katika kitengo cha Gordon?

1287
01:55:29.420 --> 01:55:30.780
Sijui, yeye kamwe kuniambia.

1288
01:55:31.060 --> 01:55:33.640
Sikiliza, Den, ninaapa kwa Mungu, sikujua watakufanyia nini.

1289
01:55:39.340 --> 01:55:40.860
Sijui nini kitakutokea wewe pia.

1290
01:55:48.470 --> 01:55:48.830
Nzuri sana.

1291
01:55:50.750 --> 01:55:51.110
Ni jambo lisilo la maadili.

1292
01:55:52.830 --> 01:55:53.190
Ni hatari.

1293
01:55:54.050 --> 01:55:57.850
Umegeuza kila simu ya mkononi katika Gotham kuwa kipaza sauti.

1294
01:55:58.170 --> 01:56:00.290
Na jenereta ya juu ya mzunguko wa kupokea.

1295
01:56:00.830 --> 01:56:05.690
Ulichukua wazo langu la sonar na kuutumia kwenye kila simu katika mji.

1296
01:56:06.170 --> 01:56:09.430
Kwa nusu ya mji kukupa chakula sonar, unaweza picha Gotham nzima.

1297
01:56:12.590 --> 01:56:13.870
Hilo si sawa.

1298
01:56:14.210 --> 01:56:14.390
Katika

1299
01:56:17.910 --> 01:56:19.210
gharama gani?

1300
01:56:19.570 --> 01:56:20.990
Hifadhidata si muhimu.

1301
01:56:26.100 --> 01:56:28.020
Hii ni nguvu nyingi sana kwa mtu mmoja.

1302
01:56:28.460 --> 01:56:29.580
Hiyo ndiyo sababu nilikupa.

1303
